umb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Solve the Open Hand Temple Murders\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Solve_the_Open_Hand_Temple_Murders\" title=\"Solve the Open Hand Temple Murders\">Solve the Open Hand Temple Murders</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The holder of this pass is to be provided with access to Lower City.\n</p><p><br>\n- Investigator Valeria\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195707\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2075/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31572/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7548/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936632/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.621      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.621      1 -total\n 57.08%   27.182      9 Template:Icon_text\n 50.37%   23.987     22 Template:Trim\n 19.30%    9.189      2 Template:Uid\n 17.53%    8.347      4 Template:Icon_link\n 14.57%    6.938      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.29%    5.376      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.45%    4.977      9 Template:Ifempty\n  9.71